Change: Validate usernames from `--proxy-auth-username`

With `--proxy-auth-username`, rest-server accepted any username from the
configured header. Usernames from that header must now consist of letters,
digits and the characters `@`, `.`, `_` and `-`, like usernames in
`.htpasswd`. Requests with any other username are now rejected with HTTP
status 401.

https://github.com/restic/rest-server/pull/415
